  exact @_root_.AiryFdd.dOp_sub_goeOp

/-- For w >= 0, d > 0, the trace norm of K21 = P e^{-d Lap} B0 P is at most C exp(-Psi(d,w) + 16(1+w+d^2)), Psi = (2/3)(2w+d^2)^{3/2} + 2wd + (2/3)d^3, via the heat split at tuned weight gamma = s + sqrt(2w+s^2). -/
