  exact @_root_.AiryFdd.traceENorm_k21Op_le

/-- There is C > 0 such that for w >= 0, d > 0 and every bounded R with norm <= 2, the trace norm of (D - B) + K21 R Q is at most C exp(-I(w) - 2wd + 20(1+w+d^2)), I(w) = (2/3)(2w)^{3/2}. -/
